Outrun zombies, literally, or be their dinner! 
Add fun and motivation to running! 
Ease into 5k. Move on to 25k! 
Create exciting videos with your runs and share with friends or the world!

PokemonGo companion: Run this app in the background while hunting for pokemons or incubating eggs, thus creating your own pokemonGo routes that you can share!

ABOUT:
This is an exciting game that gets you out there and start moving around physically. Your avatar in the game is controlled by your actual running. You have to move your butt, not just your fingers.

FEATURES:
Integration with Health app;
3 game modes to select from: 
-- Time-based (Run for a fixed length of time);
-- Distance-based (Run for a fixed distance);
-- No-zombies (For recording your route);
Your avatar will always be kept in focus on the map as you run;
On the fly info regarding your mileage and time;
Visually trace your route on a live map;
Keeps a log of your running history with annotated maps and animated avatars; 
view replays of your runs with animated avatars of yourself and the zombies;
Set the length of time you want to run before the zombies give up the chase (from 2 min to 2 hour2);
Set the distance you want to run before the zombies give up the chase (from 0.25km to 10km)
Set speed of zombies (slow, fast or crazy);
Enjoy your own music while running;
Audio warning when zombies are closing in;
Audio reminders at various stages of run;
Set regular background alarm;
Concentrate on your run without having to stare at the screen;
share full running records (including maps and animated avatars) with friends;

WARNING:
Do NOT play the competitive modes while driving;
Do NOT play the competitive modes where there's heavy human traffic.
Please use common sense when using this app. We will not be held responsible for any damage or injury done to or by the user.
Continued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life.
This app needs constant internet connection during your run.

HINT:
Having good GPS signal throughout the chase is important to beat the zombies! Translation: run in open areas where you can see the sky!

SOTKA has already helped 500 000 people all over the world to transform their lives! Now it is available in English!

This is a free educational course developed for those, who only start their training or get back on a track after a long break or injury. Our main goal - to educate and train people of any age, gender or physical conditions.

SOTKA program is designed for 100 days, during which you will everyday get new useful information and perform training complexes consisted of basic bodyweight exercises.

SOTKA is divided into 2 big theory blocks, each covering all the main topics and providing answers to all your questions. 

BASIC Block (Day 1 to Day 49): 
- Detailed review of bodyweight exercises;
- Detailed review of nutrition; 
- Infoposts with answers to the most popular beginner's questions: how to breath, how to improve flexibility, how to train during summer/winter, how to learn pull-ups from scratch, how much water to drink, how long should training session be and etc. 

ADVANCED Block (Day 50 to Day 91): 
- Exercise's biomechanics and muscle work;
- New training techniques every week;
- Detailed review on different body systems;
- Practicum on training programms development; 

TURBO Block (Day 92 to Day 98):
- Challenge yourself with 7 unique training routines; 

APPLE WATCH & APPLE HEALTH:
- train using the Apple Watch;
- track your progress through the Health application (the app requests access to Health to obtain data on heart rate, personal parameters and training data).
